  "description": "MainLibProj_Hrithik is a comprehensive, production-ready utility library for .NET 8+ projects, designed to simplify enterprise development with built-in security, FIX trading, and Azure utilities.\n\n\t\t\t------------------------------------------------------------\n\t\t\tNEW IN v2.6.0 — SECURE TRANSACTIONS (JWS + JWE)\n\t\t\t------------------------------------------------------------\n\n\t\t\tThis release introduces a new Secure Transactions module designed for\n\t\t\tbanking and financial systems requiring strong confidentiality and integrity.\n\n\t\t\tThe module is built on industry-standard JWT technologies:\n\n\t\t\t• JWS (RS256) for message integrity and non-repudiation\n\t\t\t• JWE (RSA-OAEP + AES) for payload confidentiality\n\t\t\t• Envelope-based transport model\n\t\t\t• Strongly-typed payload support\n\t\t\t• Time-bound tokens to mitigate replay attacks\n\n\t\t\tThe Secure Transactions API provides a clean abstraction over cryptography,\n\t\t\tallowing developers to securely exchange business payloads without directly\n\t\t\thandling JWT or encryption primitives.\n\n\t\t\t------------------------------------------------------------\n\t\t\tSECURE TRANSACTION EXAMPLE\n\t\t\t------------------------------------------------------------\n\n\t\t\tvar payload = new TestTransaction\n\t\t\t{\n\t\t\tTransactionId = \"TX123\",\n\t\t\tAmount = 5000,\n\t\t\tCurrency = \"INR\"\n\t\t\t};\n\n\t\t\tvar token = secureService.CreateSecureRequest(\n\t\t\tpayload,\n\t\t\trecipientPublicKey: serverPublicKey,\n\t\t\tsenderPrivateKey: clientPrivateKey,\n\t\t\toptions: new SecureTransactionOptions\n\t\t\t{\n\t\t\tIssuer = \"bank-client\",\n\t\t\tAudience = \"payment-api\",\n\t\t\tExpiryMinutes = 5\n\t\t\t});\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\tvar result = secureService.DecryptAndValidate<TestTransaction>(\n\t\t\ttoken,\n\t\t\tsenderPublicKey: clientPublicKey,\n\t\t\trecipientPrivateKey: serverPrivateKey);\n\n\n\t\t\t------------------------------------------------------------\n\t\t\tOLD PACKAGE SUMMARY\n\n\t\t\t------------------------------------------------------------\n\t\t\tJWT ENCRYPTION DECRYPTION\n\t\t\t- Added RSA-encrypted JWT decryption and encoding - decoding support using AES.\n\t\t\t- Extract raw JWT and claims using a simple API.\n\t\t\t- No breaking changes to existing FIX or utility features.\n\n\n\t\t\tFIX PROTOCOL INTEGRATION (QuickFIX/n)\n\t\t\tBuilt-in FIX connectivity powered by QuickFIX/n.\n\t\t\tSend JSON-based orders (Equity, Fractional, Notional, Option, Multi-Leg) without dealing with raw FIX messages.\n\t\t\tSupports local certificates and Azure Key Vault-based authentication.\n\n\t\t\t------------------------------------------------------------\n\t\t\tCORE UTILITIES\n\t\t\t- Excel - JSON conversion (Workbook and Worksheet level)\n\t\t\t- Word (.docx) → PDF conversion using OpenXML + PdfSharpCore\n\t\t\t- Azure Blob Storage helpers\n\t\t\t- Azure Key Vault integration (Secrets, Keys, Certificates)\n\t\t\t- JSON utilities for serialization and validation\n\t\t\t- Retry Policy and Circuit Breaker helpers\n\t\t\t- Validation utilities (PAN, Aadhaar, IFSC, GSTIN, Email)\n\n\t\t\t------------------------------------------------------------\n\t\t\tIdeal For:\n\t\t\tEnterprise-grade .NET 8+ applications requiring security, FIX trading, and Azure-ready utilities.\n\n\t\t\tCompatible With:\n\t\t\t.NET 8+, Azure services, FIX 4.2 compliant brokers.\n\n\t\t\t💬 Contact:\n\t\t\t📧 hrithikkalra11@gmail.com\n\t\t\t☕ https://www.buymeacoffee.com/alkylhalid9",
