  "releaseNotes": "Version 2.6.0:\n\t\t\t- Added Secure Transactions module using JWS (RS256) + JWE (RSA-OAEP + AES).\n\t\t\t- Introduced envelope-based encryption and signing for banking-style secure communication.\n\t\t\t- Strongly-typed APIs for secure request creation and validation.\n\t\t\t- Dependency-injection friendly design with configurable issuer, audience, and expiry.\n\t\t\t- Existing Hybrid JWT, FIX, and utility features remain unchanged.",
